{"kind":"semantic_job_design_response","schemaVersion":"5.0.0","asset":{"kind":"semantic_stage_asset_candidate","schemaVersion":"5.0.0","requirementCandidates":[],"worksiteDesign":null,"statements":[{"statementRef":"design-statement:01-subject-topology","modality":"normative","text":"The subject root is the worksite root ".". The eight source-named surfaces are placed at exactly the relative paths the source gives: specification/project-conformance.md, design/implementation-design.md, package.json, src/hello.mjs, design/test-design.md, test/component/hello.test.mjs, test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs and test-execution-plan.json. Because of this, the verifiers' "../../src/hello.mjs" specifier and the plan's args resolve without change.

