Four of these choices are design decisions within the space the source leaves open, not source obligations (req-pressure:07, req-pressure:11): the exact file bodies, the absence of imports, the absence of output, and the two-key package.json.","sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":0,"quote":"src/hello.mjs must export helloWorld() returning exactly"},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"package.json must be private:true and type:module."},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"expectedStdout: null"}],"requirementRefs":[14,15,16],"obligationRefs":[0,1,2],"predecessorStatementRefs":[37,38,39]},{"statementRef":"design-statement:03-governing-documents","modality":"normative","text":"The three documents carry the content the source requires, as text a checker can find.

