None of the three documents holds code, a plan or a claimed result. check-documents proves only that these elements are present; faithfulness is left to semantic assessment (req-pressure:13).","sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":0,"quote":"Declare the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal."},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"Name the required downstream lifecycle surfaces: implementation design, source, test design, component test source, UAT test source, test execution plan, and test execution result."},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"State that ABG owns startup admission, registry selection, graph-call opening, vector traversal, F_P dispatch, evidence admission, event emission, closure, and convergence."},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"Use the prior conformance_project artifact as the authority."},{"memberRef":0,"quote":"Specify both component and UAT validation obligations."}],"requirementRefs":[18,19,20],"obligationRefs":[4,5,6],"predecessorStatementRefs":[41,42,43]},{"statementRef":"design-statement:04-verifiers","modality":"normative","text":"Each verifier contains:
